WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.125
An inequality is a region: every point that makes it true.

2
00:00:04.977 --> 00:00:10.002
The boundary is the line. It is dashed, so the line itself is not included.

3
00:00:10.931 --> 00:00:15.331
Test a point. Zero is less than one: true, so shade that side.

4
00:00:16.158 --> 00:00:19.483
Four is not less than three, so A is outside.
